// # 32. Normal function vs arrow function

// | Feature                     | Normal Function | Arrow Function |
// | --------------------------- | --------------- | -------------- |
// | Concise syntax              | ❌               | ✅              |
// | Own `this`                  | ✅               | ❌              |
// | `this`                      | Call-site based | Lexical        |
// | Own `arguments`             | ✅               | ❌              |
// | Can use `new`               | ✅               | ❌              |
// | `prototype` property        | Usually ✅       | ❌              |
// | `call()` can change `this`  | ✅               | ❌              |
